msgstr "Client ID"

#: includes/admin-social.php:413
msgid "Secret"
msgstr "Secret"

#: includes/admin-social.php:421
msgid "Show the button"
msgstr "Mostrare il pulsante"

#: includes/admin-social.php:430
msgid "The buttons are drawn by the sign-in shortcode, together with the email form. There is nothing else to place."
msgstr "I pulsanti li disegna lo shortcode di accesso, insieme al modulo e-mail. Non c’è altro da posizionare."

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/admin-social.php:442
#, php-format
msgid "A direct link to sign in with %s, if you want it somewhere else:"
msgstr "Un link diretto per accedere con %s, se lo vuoi da un’altra parte:"

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/admin-social.php:469
#, php-format
msgid "To let people sign in with their %s account you have to create an app there. Below is the whole thing, click by click."
msgstr "Perché le persone possano accedere con il loro account %s bisogna creare un’app lì. Qui c’è tutto, clic per clic."

#: includes/admin-social.php:476
msgid "The URL they are going to ask you for"
msgstr "La URL che ti chiederanno"

#: includes/admin-social.php:477
msgid "Keep it at hand: one of the steps below asks for it, and it has to be pasted exactly as it is."
msgstr "Tienila a portata di mano: uno dei passi qui sotto la chiede, e va incollata esattamente com’è."

#: includes/admin-social.php:479
msgid "Depending on the provider it is called redirect URI, callback URL, return URL or authorized redirect URL."
msgstr "A seconda del provider si chiama redirect URI, callback URL, return URL o authorized redirect URL."

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/admin-social.php:486
#, php-format
msgid "Step by step in %s"
msgstr "Passo per passo in %s"

#: includes/admin-social.php:494
msgid "Open the console"
msgstr "Apri la console"

#: includes/admin-social.php:508
msgid "Watch out:"
msgstr "Attenzione:"

#: includes/admin-social.php:514
